# Ad-infinitum agent context

**Read `AGENTS.md` first** — knowledge graph, file map, branch history, live demo architecture.

## What this repo is

F2FS garbage-collection research (Greedy / Cost-Benefit / ATGC). Kernel sources in `fs/f2fs/` (C, GPL-2.0). 2026 tooling in `tools/`, `benchmarks/`, `docs/`.

## Edit boundaries

| Area | Path | Language | Notes |
|------|------|----------|-------|
| Kernel GC | `fs/f2fs/gc.c` | C only | No C++; match kernel style |
| Live demo | `tools/live-gc-server.py`, `docs/live.html` | Python + HTML | Port **8765**; 3 parallel policies |
| Experiments | `tools/*.sh`, `benchmarks/` | Shell + fio | Linux + F2FS mount to run |
| Docs | `docs/`, `README.md` | Markdown/HTML | Live link → `localhost:8765` |

## Live demo (simulation, not real kernel)

```bash
python tools/live-gc-server.py   # → http://localhost:8765/live.html
```

Do not serve `live.html` via static `:8080` only — SSE requires the Python server.

## Git

- Best 2016 branch: `origin/policy2` (FG_GC early-exit)
- `master` = stock 4.1.8 `gc.c`
